e":"樺山","textMapHash":1156623162,"text":"あ、ありがとう。でもいいんだ。それよりも、君はよそから来たのかい？","nextNodeIds":[722340107]},{"nodeId":722340107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4189551010,"text":"うん。","nextNodeIds":[722340108]},{"nodeId":722340108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20343,"speakerName":"樺山","textMapHash":1977448410,"text":"ならばきっと色々見てきただろう。僕は外へ旅したことが無い、引っ越しの経験は豊富だけどね。","nextNodeIds":[722340109]},{"nodeId":722340109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20343,"speakerName":"樺山","textMapHash":4067994242,"text":"それ言っちゃうと思い出しちゃった…","nextNodeIds":[722340110]},{"nodeId":722340110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20343,"speakerName":"樺山","textMapHash":1174902858,"text":"小さい時は引っ越しが多かったせいで、友達を作る機会があまりなかった。色んな景色を見てきたけど、ぼくにはそれを共有できる人がいない…","nextNodeIds":[722340111]},{"nodeId":722340111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20343,"speakerName":"樺山","textMapHash":2862155970,"text":"僕が見てきた景色を、君にも見せてあげたい。そしてもし君がそこに旅しに行ったら、帰って感想を聞かせて。","nextNodeIds":[722340112]},{"nodeId":722340112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20343,"speakerName":"樺山","textMapHash":4096757154,"text":"一つは狭間の街の一番高いところにある石門の下、一つは常夜霊廟の近くにある珊瑚に囲まれた空き地で、最後の一つは蛇心の地の残壁の近くにある。","nextNodeIds":[722340113]},{"nodeId":722340113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20343,"speakerName":"樺山","textMapHash":3403897426,"text":"僕はその3か所に印をつけて、高いところ明かりを灯したから、簡単に見つかると思うよ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7223401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUE